From 2405ff9a7ae81bb5c36e632b2381d900c0c8ee5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avium A16 Reproducer <avium-a16-reproducer@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 13:21:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wm: enable window decorations with desk-less default display
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Dagger providers gating the desktop-mode window decorations
(DesktopModeWindowDecorViewModel) key off
canEnterDesktopModeOrShowAppHandle, which is false once the default display
is kept desk-less, so no captions / 窗口栏 are created for any task.  Host
windows therefore have no caption to drag, no top-left menu and no
fullscreen control.  Override the property in ShellDesktopStateImpl: the
decoration infrastructure comes up, while the desk root stays gated on
canEnterDesktopMode (false), and the 0006 visibility gate still limits
captions to Waydroid host + freeform tasks.

Change-Id: I5b3150bd98008cc9b173c5d326e9dffa2d0418f9
---
 .../android/wm/shell/desktopmode/ShellDesktopStateImpl.kt  | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/ShellDesktopStateImpl.kt b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/ShellDesktopStateImpl.kt
index 56cf945bf20f..05dcbd8a5eab 100644
--- a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/ShellDesktopStateImpl.kt
+++ b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/ShellDesktopStateImpl.kt
@@ -29,6 +29,13 @@ class ShellDesktopStateImpl(
     private val shellController: ShellController,
     private val shellTaskOrganizer: ShellTaskOrganizer,
 ) : ShellDesktopState, DesktopState by desktopState {
+    // Waydroid host windows need the window decorations (caption / 窗口栏,
+    // including the top-left menu and fullscreen control) even while the
+    // default display stays desk-less.  The desk root itself remains gated on
+    // canEnterDesktopMode (false in this build), so this only brings up the
+    // decoration infrastructure.
+    override val canEnterDesktopModeOrShowAppHandle: Boolean = true
+
     /** Checks if the given display has an active desktop session (i.e., running freeform tasks). */
     private fun isInDesktop(displayId: Int): Boolean =
         desktopUserRepositories
